{"job_id":"F-501fdeb06e2b2928e75e","family_id":"F-501fdeb06e2b2928e75e","title":"재외공무원재해보상규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":11,"target_id":"9a8745f58ab8c3f343f65bcdd7b8a7da15266c6a67f5ddaec17dd805cdfd8443","source_hash":"361069ad38765716480940fb99de1afc23f0db75dd951008b82a653216df5107","text":"海外公务员意外事故赔偿条例"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":113,"target_id":"08e5310c2c324ea023adb469696a8810d5deab1d25e4a08cb24c8e61b761de8a","source_hash":"fc0e3cb47916f830a70eb21eb65639c1dc8f0a05a617743418be3d6402bb6b97","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是根据《外交事务法》第二十二条和第三十一条的规定，规定海外公职人员在海外任职期间遭受财产损失的赔偿事宜。<2001年6月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":113,"end":561,"target_id":"59a72e69b8cdc4c3e8561a047d903a4728bf0e37a68385502cbb82bce077a188","source_hash":"abbd4a2735099029ffd6cc466b681e69b1c271162cd00466318a8f2282612f1a","text":"第二条（定义）本法令所用术语的定义如下。<2001年1月4日修订>\n1. “海外公务员”一词是指在韩国驻外使团任职的外交官、根据《驻外使团常驻官员任命条例》在驻外使团任职的常驻官员、根据《驻外使团武官派遣条例》在驻外使团任职的常驻武官、根据《国家公务员法》第32条之4款派往驻外使团的公务员，以及在驻外使团任职的其他一般或特殊公务员。\n2。“海外服务期”是指海外公职人员从前往海外外交使团任职之日起至接到遣返命令返回之日止的期间。\n3. “月薪”一词是指根据公务员的职级和类型支付的月薪，即按12个月平均计算的年度工资和年终津贴总额，以及按公务员服务年限平均计算的年度常规服务津贴、工作津贴和海外服务津贴总额。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":561,"end":1153,"target_id":"0bc425a44df8e1544e909c9c29037d65ff973260f411de62c85497ee436ccfda","source_hash":"9f6303428ba8f50eb29e780b862fceff1eb1791c16b3d7f9601cfdfc7bd7834c","text":"第三条（赔偿请求和支付）\n① 海外公职人员在海外任职期间，因《外交事务法》第二十二条规定的原因遭受重大财产损失的，可以申请灾害赔偿（以下简称“赔偿”）。<2001年6月30日修订>\n② 就第1款所述情形而言，如相关公职人员已死亡，其家属可依第1款规定请求赔偿。在此情形下，《公职人员意外事故赔偿法》第3条及第11条的规定，对有权获得赔偿的家属范围及优先顺序，参照适用。<2018年9月18日修订>\n③ 任何希望申请赔偿的人员，应在财产损失发生后一年内，经相关外交使团团长确认后，向外交部长提交《海外公务员灾害赔偿申请书》，并附上下列各款所列文件。外交部长认为必要时，可准许省略全部或部分所附文件。<2008年12月31日修订，2013年3月23日修订>\n1. 损坏物品清单（必须附上注明价格和购买日期的收据或证明文件）\n2. 损害赔偿声明\n④ 根据第3款规定提出灾害赔偿请求时，外交部长应当按照附表所列标准支付赔偿金。<2008年12月31日、2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1153,"end":1232,"target_id":"1d23fab7a123a0a29b97ebc86ec38585e238147fd102f044b883e34bfb2273f3","source_hash":"40d1a600eaf8e230fef89f332ba3ab3a5039bacd6a4432042e8e2c1a98080e04","text":"第四条（赔偿限额）根据第三条第四款规定给予的赔偿，不得超过事故发生时有关海外公职人员月薪的六倍。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1232,"end":1445,"target_id":"2c22edf5da4bb2c9540b5454364a3b7b10404e35faca2fafce4180e7c2893981","source_hash":"73ceeed9582b6255c5ef9268d7cd5fe35d5590e2116d9bb20c3bb214779bda3e","text":"第五条（与其他补偿的关系）\n① 根据其他法律，国家或地方政府可以支付与本法令规定的补偿相同种类的补偿等的，应当从本法令规定的补偿中扣除该补偿金额并予以支付。\n② 根据东道国政府或东道国保险相关法律法规，如果可以根据本法令获得损害赔偿等，则该等赔偿金额应从根据本法令获得的赔偿中扣除并支付。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1445,"end":1621,"target_id":"a53d6963d4a463ece7f72bf7fcf0eaa33f8373bf0fc5c864de3a911bb1f21647","source_hash":"04d64c3758df616a77ca724e57285d9d421a68a03abfd6e741c19138660bbabd","text":"第六条（归还国家）  如果国家按照本法令提供补偿后收回了补偿物，则该补偿物的所有权归还国家。但是，已获得补偿的人可以通过将外交部长确定的补偿金和利息返还给国家，收回补偿物的所有权。<2008年12月31日修订；2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1621,"end":1714,"target_id":"7b1c83fc9798267adbbf9cd1c0d1bc0359fab87b7b97de40124ccf2aee6ceab8","source_hash":"9809aafeb08f232fc4b7a53ec24e0a99ef8044911d8a5ff36c3c1722c6697f73","text":"第七条（灾害补偿储备基金）为履行本法令规定的补偿义务，外交部年度预算中可设立海外公职人员灾害补偿储备基金。<2008年12月31日修订；2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1714,"end":1900,"target_id":"f8b193cbdcdcdc3b530cdf2684c95fff673ed9d259153cf25ae335b9d68d42d7","source_hash":"82b92167f1272fd425fc246620af3fe67e2fccd47ba240d85ee4db8c75015c67","text":"补充规定 <第13566号，1992年1月3日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（适用范围）本法令关于灾害赔偿的规定适用于1990年1月1日或之后发生的损害。对于本法令生效前发生的损害，尽管有第3条第3款的规定，赔偿请求必须在本法令生效后三个月内提出。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1900,"end":1936,"target_id":"5ea211bb03953f34faa1b9eb37956886c5765613477e1e8b91c3a65fb4ad3a1a","source_hash":"ddb4d6b82baba5f94f867f1fb6dd8677294b5c943a927f6e3aa8bd64118374a6","text":"补充规定（关于公务员津贴等的规定）<2001年1月4日第17104号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1936,"end":1986,"target_id":"72eedc650df5569b5705b115b742a656336555d9970df337f8caf97d29a7991c","source_hash":"5ffe13b04b5bb40e8e7f192a580a6cb1156be714ea576d17df4c5857fa0f622f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效，但自2001年1月1日起适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1986,"end":2000,"target_id":"60a99b756ee8269847b5c42fe98f64ca5fe6cf02a3b4d6f5c904b77ad140aea3","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2000,"end":2102,"target_id":"3d3351af94a0b2f272c3e48f1d17c72c18e4a2667643fc9bf6d0351d6a8e9bdf","source_hash":"bafc750c087f297f1428627f51cc94b076a7da16d4b900b4b4c49a03d55aa77f","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 对涉及海外公职人员的意外事故赔偿规定修改如下。\n\n  在第二条第三款中，“常规服务津贴和长期服务津贴”应改为“常规服务津贴”。\n\n  ③ 至 ⑭ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2102,"end":2136,"target_id":"3742adeb1276239616a88470826b7ed6e3ec89cecb7e656cc44f39bd92edab2e","source_hash":"1a9579adadd7a8065f3eae91e158cd75c89355a2a7b856a607c5788a1c263698","text":"增补（关于任命外事官员的条例）<2001年6月30日第17269号条例>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2136,"end":2180,"target_id":"0ed77ed84a4536cf4b50d96a4736d335f86e165cb0a56661f782a4a2177d3e56","source_hash":"068a92c4e8a582adac6a6e82bf0f31703006dd6a98cfc657015cfc811938e425","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2001年7月1日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2180,"end":2195,"target_id":"beb8f65568d75bbee46d8ab1265e47fa646b832dfa6ca3b60076d408878631f8","source_hash":"83d7e2617f4bf3ca8b29241abcde12e5b43dc5f987d1316993039fbd766a366d","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2195,"end":2358,"target_id":"104448c5ccf7ecc17c09bcd545070683398bee9a87c62cce4a6c2ac2c1bc06b1","source_hash":"30d012ed470a252c45e8b947e8c5a8932bd80aa6c5551aa174fc09d138db1f7b","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至⑦ 省略\n\n  ⑧ 对涉及海外公职人员的意外事故赔偿规定修改如下。\n\n  第 1 条中的“外交事务法第 19 条和第 24 条”应改为“外交事务法第 22 条和第 31 条”。\n\n  在第三条第一款中，“外交事务法第十九条”应改为“外交事务法第二十二条”。\n\n  ⑨省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2358,"end":2401,"target_id":"1428694e08a1e75a2a82ba5b865081e014c1a1dfb23aa399649fafdd1c6bd471","source_hash":"0a879bcf7b396fc951de850c2451a22d9758802ce3c4c6191534aff21dd9f1f5","text":"增编（外交贸易部及其附属机构组织结构）<2008年12月31日第21241号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2401,"end":2436,"target_id":"785fe87800bbece0f9ec54d21962af7cbc6edc64af3ab1954e01af0ee8d76821","source_hash":"6b2cce9c211671894b8f8a8a40d9864e5da5674e9685180cbbb27d1ed4186eea","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2009年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2436,"end":2576,"target_id":"d4957e0aec07e43f02b5a99d97ac9471ee71f8b7fffc0288019f5288f396bdd6","source_hash":"df9441a4d6d121d668fef22d072b109a5350d942a6fe6821b0a03ddb65ccc4d0","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑪ 省略\n\n  ⑫ 《涉及海外公职人员的意外事故赔偿条例》部分修订如下。\n\n  除第3条第3款、第3条第4款的子款和第6条的但书外，本条第一部分和第二部分中的“外交部长”应改为“外交和贸易部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2576,"end":2613,"target_id":"f79016511638c9d7f691c8ec59e04b5056a2e47ef45c19841673193c0af7baf4","source_hash":"343f31ba4bbc0d9d659a26a3138456bd499bd86fedf20744803c4bda1490d194","text":"  第 7 条中的“外交部”应改为“外交贸易部”。\n\n  ⑬ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2613,"end":2653,"target_id":"19cdd3de967c836ee96c9336dbc51d2ffe37c7d756c9e18ebe18ba30cbb3bd6b","source_hash":"c065a4c939b9f2b1757f690983bd3df53ac92d65142803e4c9773d2adbc21e45","text":"增编（外交部及其附属机构组织结构）<2013年3月23日第24424号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2653,"end":2682,"target_id":"fc1ea65b2ba30d4b1b60ef08bbd424dff5f1fc4de63f9dce876fd0ab8ee0720d","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2682,"end":2699,"target_id":"0571128cb3727d9947b49c47b173346c6faa47bf9bce6cb4a060750208b04dc5","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第2至7条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2699,"end":2835,"target_id":"b577983ba2f4b29cd27696ce0004f556b91b37646bc7e7724ef242783d598948","source_hash":"e6d459aed8410da6175653c9e41f66f485535f0ca47e1a370e1b76f80631a2be","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至⑬ 已省略\n\n  14. 对涉及海外公职人员的事故赔偿规定作如下部分修改。\n\n  在第3条导言部分的第一部分和第二部分、该条的第3款、第4款以及第6条但书中，“外交和贸易部长”应改为“外交部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2835,"end":2881,"target_id":"77000d1636f32762bc7be5fbfa3d218627ce91a6b9694ec45d47ce7e9d0c575d","source_hash":"4cb4b3638bdb3f532de76cd92568db97a0fd7c5646da30939dca4a1111ff24b2","text":"  第七条中的“外交贸易部”应改为“外交部”。\n\n  省略 ⑮ 至 <22>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2881,"end":2920,"target_id":"fa2c4213b06e9c1c4b9bf987f18996cd3617504b94750084e33f07c43191b87a","source_hash":"4e254c4ab7adb02f8352d7750d88bbc8cc28745e25ff1fd643e745aae804bf44","text":"补充规定（公务员意外事故赔偿法实施令）<第29180号，2018年9月18日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2920,"end":2956,"target_id":"076bec9ac9ef3d938c449c2e6d7054ed22f0bf1ae6a5e64caa0b19b233dabf09","source_hash":"6620540ce1dc6bc4e308c8379d45a487b7cfdd688c0aa88777d825352b83130e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2018年9月21日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2956,"end":2974,"target_id":"6e6e98cfcb714ffa2274d11f8bd8046f3140df05d754f3d2ffc9f2281441ab0d","source_hash":"2b83ca49596a392eb4c045e1bf01b80249fb2d487c79e70104f516705866fb5f","text":"省略第2条至第17条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2974,"end":3139,"target_id":"01a6d679173513cdfce66a6b190a6810b3db0f2d70be6a6c2d71551367d170d3","source_hash":"dae306b9092b88a0d4aa3be7d5e4bebb550583113fdfbb12b04df1b6fb9c3ddd","text":"第十八条（修改其他法律）①至<34> 已省略\n\n  <35> 《涉及海外公职人员的意外事故赔偿条例》部分修订如下。\n\n  在第三条第二款的后半部分，“公务员退休金法”第三条、第二十八条、第二十九条的规定”应改为“公务员意外事故赔偿法”第三条、第十一条的规定。\n\n  <36> 至 <43> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3139,"end":4049,"target_id":"dcbeb8301e7b385b75dd94aca3f37ce821dcfb33b7a30dc0767e0b0e2416e3de","source_hash":"ae4228d0054d9393167107514b5572486fdbce76580fb400c6b4dd5f08e661a3","text":"第19条省略\n\n损害赔偿标准 [与第3条第4款相关]\n[星号]                                                                      \n\n  损害赔偿标准（与第3条第4款相关）                                        \n\n┏━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃损坏物品┃赔偿标准┃\n\n┣━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┫\n\n┃车辆┃ ○ 如遇遗失或损坏，折旧金额将从购买价格中扣除 ┃\n\n┃ ┃ 金额减去 ┃\n\n┃ ┃ ○ 部分损坏时的维修费用 ┃\n\n┣━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┫\n\n┃家居用品和┃○单件购买价值300美元或以上的商品┃\n\n┃个人物品┃车辆赔偿标准适用。┃\n\n┃ ┃ ○ 关于丢失或无法使用的配饰和衣物，一月 ┃\n\n┃ ┃月薪金额 ┃\n\n┗━━━━━━┻━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n   备注：车辆、家用物品等的折旧，在购买后第一年每月折旧额为购买价格的100%。    \n\n  2/100，此后每月按购买价格的 1/100 的比例偿还。"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00001","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201070","source_hash":"810887963502c1f110e51796f1290318a00f115ef05a52612a8b0a60024f1e2f","text":"[星号]"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00002","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201071","source_hash":"a8ed5c9469c70be3afab5b78ae3887e16927ca54c31c85d012a062862e2c1454","text":"损害赔偿标准（与第3条第4款相关）"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00003","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201072","source_hash":"a0f8217d5b1c709d6586311b279c0fd474067793e9ecd586ed0eef11a9608be3","text":"损坏物品"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00004","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201073","source_hash":"92df3560ba6f7b12d06021feec9f1ff9273575f966dc44fa803afe5fdb1cd08c","text":"奖励标准 MTQ026fde1e36523f5100050结束"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00005","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201074","source_hash":"02cb09e20c94f20310b29a27a92c46ec41a32ba48575ad539c39b2ab3f3b56a6","text":"车辆"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00006","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201075","source_hash":"699f48b8dec142c26a5e7af6758e540d4252dd97b02ea9babd3688868c12bdf6","text":"如发生遗失或损坏，折旧金额将从购买价格中扣除。"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00007","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201077","source_hash":"2fe04f14884a4ccc8dd8a8cc880d93b8496cfb624fb31c66b7c54497aad57fbc","text":"如果只是部分损坏，则需支付维修费用。"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00008","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201078","source_hash":"1ede87744cdec0ef60f4b1f9fb368f3ced218ca6acecc0732400769a3749069e","text":"家用工具和"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00009","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201079","source_hash":"1209593d9036d773ad2a0ab753ad96bf49438e6406cc7ea2207587c73d6d5dd1","text":"单件商品购买价值达到或超过 300 美元的商品"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00010","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201080","source_hash":"c8ea9fbeedb2450412e6914df66ebfd5edac9a36c75a7578f4fcfab23702094b","text":"个人物品"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00011","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201081","source_hash":"61f1ba70c23f4151c2b2eee715b3b40354b7c65a087f0452f4297fda91a31637","text":"适用车辆赔偿标准。"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00012","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201082","source_hash":"163db57fe9deb3eb04a92fedcab0207f7bc4bc6b575eed94bc981ff533f6fc34","text":"关于丢失或无法使用的配件和衣物，1 月 ○"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00013","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201083","source_hash":"4c460afde801d7445ec915ed8e9b82d3f8e590e6cf79d1e167911790f8dcd981","text":"对应于月度报酬的金额"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00014","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201084","source_hash":"8174fc02be9e37a5308ab71d83b9c09dd29f328ff259fce6cbedf9362de2c080","text":"备注：车辆、家用物品等的折旧，在购买后的第一年内，每月折旧额为购买价格的100%。"},{"id":"A30025-zh-00015","doc":"A30025","law_id":"kr-004653-204648-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201085","source_hash":"f80af0269e945777dc70149ca0bffba98311b9083c323d55d38f09135a79814a","text":"首付 2/2，之后每月按购买价格的 1/100 计算。"}]}